The IP Fabric sync now writes the chassis serial (`snHw`) to a Device's Serial field, rather than the serial IP Fabric identifies the Device by (`sn`), which Nautobot's field does not mean. The latter is recorded in the new IPFabric Unique Serial Number custom field. A Device IP Fabric reports no chassis serial for keeps the serial Nautobot holds rather than having it cleared, and the job reports how many.
